WEBVTT

00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:01.779
Times change, and so does technology.

00:04:02.238 --> 00:04:06.033
Dreams are being fulfilled
in a world of online gaming,

00:04:06.075 --> 00:04:09.161
especially in this class of competition
called esports.

00:04:09.620 --> 00:04:13.291
Esports, at its simplest,
is digital competition

00:04:13.332 --> 00:04:18.713
where you can get real-world
and virtual prizes, fame and glory.

00:04:19.547 --> 00:04:22.216
There will always be spectators,

00:04:22.258 --> 00:04:26.012
in filling stadiums with spectators,

00:04:26.053 --> 00:04:28.431
athletes, fans.

00:04:28.472 --> 00:04:34.854
But now there are arenas
filled with die-hard fans